//File:    test_limits.jtext
//Date:    2026-10-30
//Purpose: Human-editable seed for per-test control parameters (v001).
//
// Values here are loaded into the results.db testControl table at the start of runs.
// The DB is the runtime/authoritative store for these test control values.
//
// test_control: one row per test.
//   test         the test name, as add_test registers it
//   timeout_sec  the timeout in seconds
//   memory_mb    virtual memory limit for the test process (ulimit -v style, in MB).
//                0 = unlimited. Recommended for ctest, smoke, verify etc. to prevent
//                runaway memory usage.
//
